      "content": "thanks, this is a good start. for the section on modern mechanisms, can u add more detail on the specific ways banks still perpetuate these disparities? like, i want to make sure the students understand how the banking industry's current practices are fundamentally designed to disadvantage certain groups, even if they don't use \"redlining\" anymore. can u give me some concrete ways they do this?",
